speech-dispatcher-modules (0.1.0-2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Build vosk, kokoro and teratts against the private onnxruntime 1.32 of
    libonnxruntime-tts (RUNPATH), the one sherpa-onnx and the Vulkan plugin
    use.
  * New package speech-dispatcher-sherpa-onnx-vulkan-rs: the synthesizer
    sherpa-onnx on the graphics card (Piper, MMS, Supertonic).

